  "usage_note": "This entry covers **tomorrow** used as a noun: as a subject (*tomorrow is Friday*), with **'s** (*tomorrow's meeting*), or after a preposition (*until tomorrow*). When it says when something will happen (*I'll call you tomorrow*), **tomorrow** is an adverb, which has its own entry. The day after the next day is **the day after tomorrow**.",
